@startuml
title HCP-D03 Parking Lot / Passageway / Fee API Use Map
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "HikCentral connector profile" as Profile
component "Parking object discovery\nconfirmed API area" as Discovery
component "Passageway records\nprojection source" as Passageway
component "Live fee calculation\nnormal tariff source" as Fee
component "Payment acknowledgment\nconditional mutating capability" as Confirm
component "Central PMS" as Central

Profile --> Discovery : support mapping validation
Profile --> Passageway : operational projection
Profile --> Fee : live fee resolve where identifiers confirmed
Profile --> Confirm : disabled until approved
Discovery --> Central : mapping evidence
Passageway --> Central : projection input
Fee --> Central : vendor fee fact for TariffSnapshot
Confirm --> Central : vendor acknowledgment result

note bottom
Capability map only. Endpoint contracts, request bodies, response DTOs,
and implementation details are deferred.
end note
@enduml
